  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "7C9CA8CA2AD22CBC",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]从老师那里\\n获得了[VAR 0x0204(0001,0000)]ＢＰ！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0204",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EB837EC0B45CBB4B",
      "text": "来交换留学的学生！\\n我是辅导老师！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EB837FC0B45CBCFE",
      "text": "我就开门见山地问了，\\n你平时在打宝可梦对战吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EB8380C0B45CBEB1",
      "text": "在蓝莓学园，我们希望能让学生们\\n互相对战的气氛高涨起来。\\c\\n因此只要在巨蛋里和其他学生对战，\\n就能获得我们送出的ＢＰ，\\r\\n而且对战越多，送得就越多！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04a",
      "hash64": "8D357F72799A487F",
      "text": "首先，你就试着在草原区这里\\n战胜[VAR 0x0201(0002)]位学生吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04b",
      "hash64": "8D358072799A4A32",
      "text": "首先，你就试着在峡谷区这里\\n战胜[VAR 0x0201(0002)]位学生吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04c",
      "hash64": "8D358172799A4BE5",
      "text": "首先，你就试着在海岸区这里\\n战胜[VAR 0x0201(0002)]位学生吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_04d",
      "hash64": "8D357A72799A4000",
      "text": "首先，你就试着在极地区这里\\n战胜[VAR 0x0201(0002)]位学生吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_05a",
      "hash64": "8D39A372799E6E82",
      "text": "在草原区，\\n你战胜了……\\r\\n[VAR 0x0201(0003)]位学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0003"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_05b",
      "hash64": "8D39A272799E6CCF",
      "text": "在峡谷区，\\n你战胜了……\\r\\n[VAR 0x0201(0003)]位学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0003"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_05c",
      "hash64": "8D39A172799E6B1C",
      "text": "在海岸区，\\n你战胜了……\\r\\n[VAR 0x0201(0003)]位学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0003"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_05d",
      "hash64": "8D39A072799E6969",
      "text": "在极地区，\\n你战胜了……\\r\\n[VAR 0x0201(0003)]位学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0003"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "EB8383C0B45CC3CA",
      "text": "等你总共战胜[VAR 0x0201(0002)]位学生之后，\\n再来找我吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "EB8384C0B45CC57D",
      "text": "你很努力啊！\\n积极地和人对战，真了不起！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "EB8375C0B45CAC00",
      "text": "我就送你ＢＰ当作努力奖吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "EB8376C0B45CADB3",
      "text": "另外再多送你一个奖品！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "EB8703C0B45FD321",
      "text": "下一个目标是……\\n战胜[VAR 0x0201(0002)]位学生，但是……\\r\\n你已经完成了！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "EB8702C0B45FD16E",
      "text": "等你尽情对战之后，\\n再来拿奖品吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_12a",
      "hash64": "9637D4727ECE2F6E",
      "text": "难道说……你！\\c\\n好像已经战胜了\\n草原区的所有学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_12b",
      "hash64": "9637D3727ECE2DBB",
      "text": "难道说……你！\\c\\n好像已经战胜了\\n峡谷区的所有学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_12c",
      "hash64": "9637D2727ECE2C08",
      "text": "难道说……你！\\c\\n好像已经战胜了\\n海岸区的所有学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_12d",
      "hash64": "9637D9727ECE37ED",
      "text": "难道说……你！\\c\\n好像已经战胜了\\n极地区的所有学生！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "EB8700C0B45FCE08",
      "text": "你这么努力，\\n我要给你无与伦比努力奖！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "EB8707C0B45FD9ED",
      "text": "另外，还要多送你一个\\n无与伦比的奖品！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "EB8706C0B45FD83A",
      "text": "其他区域也会有老师在，\\n所以你在其他区域也要加油哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "EB8705C0B45FD687",
      "text": "你战胜了\\n全部区域的所有学生。\\r\\n为此，老师我要给你巨蛋最佳学生奖！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "EB8704C0B45FD4D4",
      "text": "今后你也要好好享受\\n宝可梦对战的乐趣哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_npca",
      "hash64": "3FBD3BE45404A48A",
      "text": "你居然在草原区的宝可梦对战中\\n战胜了所有学生！好厉害！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_npcb",
      "hash64": "3FBD3AE45404A2D7",
      "text": "你居然在峡谷区的宝可梦对战中\\n战胜了所有学生！好厉害！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_npcc",
      "hash64": "3FBD39E45404A124",
      "text": "你居然在海岸区的宝可梦对战中\\n战胜了所有学生！好厉害！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s2_sub_040_teacher_npcd",
      "hash64": "3FBD38E454049F71",
      "text": "你居然在极地区的宝可梦对战中\\n战胜了所有学生！好厉害！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
